      "question": "What safety statements and population qualifications are present in the selected saved Creatine NatMed annotations?",
      "source_records": [
        {
          "claim_id": "claim:88cf9029a0198b6bea27d2d1d2da03c5442592b33d5797117481f40cd41d4b3c",
