          ],
          "original_excerpt": "LIKELY SAFE when used orally and appropriately, short-term. Creatine supplementation appears to be safe when used at loading doses of up to 25 grams daily or 0.3 grams/kg daily for up to 14 days in healthy adults (1367, 2100, 2101, 3996, 4569, 10064, 15354, 15520, 46570, 46587)(46673, 46688, 46719, 46753, 46801, 103278, 103279, 108336). Creatine supplementation also appears to be safe when used at maintenance doses of 4-5 grams daily for up to 18 months (2101, 4578, 15353, 15354, 15520, 46587, 46673, 46690, 46753, 46838, 102164, 103278, 108336).",
